      "result_applied_to": "68117",
      "match_notes": "St Austell won the toss and decided to bat first at the RCG, scoring 148 a/o in 44.2 overs, J Hughes (33), J Scotland (23*) and A Bennetts (23) with the runs, Paul Trethewey 4-42 and Oli Sleeman 3-35 with the wickets for Roche.<br>In reply Roche lost a cluster of wickets to leave themselves 50-5 before a short rain delay. After which and unbeaten partnership of 101 between Toby Hall (40*) and Ian Trudgeon (29*) saw Roche home with 4 overs to spare, Jacob Inch (24) helped early on in the Roche chase. A Bennetts 4-26 doing the damage for St Austell.",
